[1.008, "o", "\u001b[1m$ ./wiki --help\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.054, "o", "usage: wiki [-h] <command> ...\r\n\r\nPersonal MBA wiki: local Gemma + retrieval over your own notes, fully offline.\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  <command>\r\n    ingest    index sources and generate linked wiki pages with Gemma\r\n    search    show original passages and their locations (no answer generated)\r\n    ask       standalone factual answer with citations, or 'insufficient evidence'\r\n    chat      personal study assistant with conversation memory\r\n    status    show model, index and wiki counts\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help  show this help message and exit\r\n\r\nexamples:\r\n  wiki ingest                         read vault/raw/, rebuild the index, write wiki pages\r\n  wiki ingest vault/raw/micro-final-cheat-sheet.md   (re)ingest one source\r\n  wiki search \"price discrimination\"  show original passages (no model needed)\r\n  wiki ask \"What is a sunk cost?\"     cited answer from your notes, or \"insufficient evidence\"\r\n  wiki chat                           talk to the study-buddy assistant\r\n  wiki status                     "]
[0.000, "o", "    show model, index and wiki counts\r\n\r\nconfiguration:\r\n  model       mlx-community/gemma-4-e4b-it-4bit   (override with WIKI_LLM)\r\n  embeddings  mlx-community/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-4bit   (override with WIKI_EMBED)\r\n  sources     vault/raw/      wiki pages  vault/wiki/      landing page  vault/index.md\r\n  index       index/          saved runs  runs/            prompts       prompts/\r\n  execution   local only (--mode local is the default; there is no online mode)\r\n"]
